{"version":1,"content":"<p>Uber將在美國三城試點兒童單獨乘車服務，最低年齡降至10歲，並為參與司機提供額外報酬。這項名為「Uber Kids」的試點計劃已在德克薩斯州奧斯汀、田納西州納什維爾和威斯康星州麥迪遜悄然上線。Uber希望通過該服務測試，是否能夠在沒有成年人陪同的情況下，為10歲至12歲的兒童提供網約車出行，並藉此拓展其客户羣體。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587220.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:01.934639+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:14:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_hash":"24aa9f504aa97766fbadffac01be878c90f539b1ac2068e1a9df3b47f263629b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}